📣📆 A quick reminder of our NEW CLASS TIMES from Monday!!!

All classes are now available to book through Wodify.

If you can’t see all the options you’re looking for, follow these steps:

1. Open your Wodify app;
2. Select ‘Schedule’ from the bottom menu;
3. Click on the ‘All classes’ drop-down menu above the days / dates, and then click on ‘Programs’;
4. This should bring up another drop-down menu with the various class / program names. Simply select the classes you wish to view / appear in your class schedule and untick any that are not of interest 😊

Class workouts can also now be viewed through the Wodify app by selecting the new ‘Workout’ option (bottom right) and then select the class from the dropdown menu in the top left.

Grab one of our coaches if you need any further help getting booked in / set up or email memberships@aristosfitness.co.uk, and we can’t wait to see you all in our NEW CLASSES next week!!! 😬💪

